ル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18870","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14033"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9186"],"vndbCharacterId":"c23142"},"originalCharacterName":"コニー・イル・リクール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Part, along with her friend Shela, of the 2-women crew of a small merchant steam-powered airship known as the Ulumensh. She's a trader, member of the 6th class frontier city of Dylas-Leen's Air Guild."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With the aid of her airship she buys, sells, exchange and deliver all sort of stuff between various neighboring locations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Orphan, still emotionally tied to her former orphanage, so much to donate most of her earnings to it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This, until the day she decides to save a mysterious green haired girl from the Empire's Army..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23142"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライアーソフト第１７弾「蒼天のセレナリア」の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛空艇ウルメンシュを操る、空の何でも屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義理堅く情に厚い。幾多のトラブルに巻き込まれながらも、力強く進んでいく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9186","sourceWorkId":"9637","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編主人公の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛空挺「ウルメンシュ」を駆って、相棒のシェラと空の「なんでも屋」を営む少女。元孤児。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明朗快活で女の子らしいしたたかさと、腹黒さを併せ持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛行艇の借金返済、整備費、修理費、孤児院への仕送りなどで常に貧乏。仕事は選ばないが、あくどい仕事はしない主義。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無限に広がる世界を飛び回り、まだ見ぬ世界の風景や人々との出会いを夢見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に理性で動くことを信条としているが、キレると事態が収拾するまで一直線に突っ走り続ける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9186","sourceWorkId":"16422","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"驾驶飞空艇『ウルメンシュ』、做着天空万用店的少女。原来是孤儿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明亮快活。拥有少女的坚强与坏嘴巴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为飞空艇的还贷、整备费、修理费、孤儿院的资助，一直都很贫困。虽然不能随意选择工作，但不做违心事是她的信条。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"梦想是踏进无限广阔的世界，遇见各种各样的人和景色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18870"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e45a9c3951cec3e02d4eb0752e41369d594a15448d37df69000e968bb1e7cf08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b31dd0513cd642dbc54140b7ca87a1ee9796a9ea34db572865196cf58d1ba353.webp","width":256,"height":232,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c30091","characterName":"セーラ・V・ウインタース","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118108","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"135838"},{"characterId":"118108","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"87678"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19548"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30091"},"originalCharacterName":"セーラ・V・ウインタース","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"行方不明になった父親を探しに西部にやってきた賞金稼ぎのガンファイター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女だてらに、一流と呼ぶにふさわしい銃の腕前を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は、明るくポジティブ。考える前に行動するタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また気が強く、一度決めたら最後までやり通す、頑固一徹なところも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19548","sourceWorkId":"3959","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライアーソフト第１２弾「Angelbullet」のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ダイムノベルを愛読し、行方不明の父を捜しながら、賞金稼ぎとして生計を立てる日々に憧れる女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19548","sourceWorkId":"9637","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b2a16f2ced3b80d4246dac56223a4eb4c3a8951142305bc4df6f6ef3523afea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e6c42dbf652c9acb31d355698c7c261137fbdfe92bd03f5cbfe02077d10132d8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c35956","characterName":"ウラシル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118131","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"135838"},{"characterId":"118131","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"60910"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14010"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35956"},"originalCharacterName":"ウラシル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ライアーソフト第１５弾「ぼーん・ふりーくす！」のヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不治の病を患った少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ一人の肉親である兄を心より慕っており、彼の考え付いた特殊な治療方法もけなげに受け入れる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14010","sourceWorkId":"9637","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"メインヒロイン。主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からずっと、病を患い、それはすでに彼女の体いたるところを蝕んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父が亡くなってからは、兄一人、妹一人の暮らしをしていて、ずっと兄である主人公に迷惑をかけてきたと思っているため、控えめな態度が染みついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素地は、年相応の明るさと元気さ、快活さを持っていて、この辺は、治療のために一時的に元気になったとたんに現れてきて、主人公を戸惑わせたり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セルの考えついた治療方法のため、一時的に健康に近い体調になり、診療所を手伝ったりしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14010","sourceWorkId":"13418","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c24372c22c05967c177115373954fccc4fca3ecf170880936fc7cc10c05d052b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9e986e0858c3b4c8a784d383f7bfc9f6636faddb20d7a217063cadc66150fc60.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c62218","characterName":"ソウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"118126","match":"exact-no